      "content": "That makes sense. It sounds like there was a lot of propaganda on both sides. Looking at it retrospectively, do you think the French justifications were actually based on real concerns for the region, or were they just excuses to maintain control? I'm trying to decide how to frame the \"moral legitimacy\" of the conflict in my script.",
